<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Swift Energy started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Swift Energy started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>BT Securities said it initiated coverage of Swift Energy Co as a buy.</p>
<p>-- set a 12-month price targer of $34 a share.</p>
<p>-- said Swift Energy has strong historical track record for creating shareholder value.</p>
<p>-- said Swift Energy has identified 425 unbooked drilling locations.</p>
<p>-- said inventory of lower-risk development projects should allow Swift to &quot;grow year-to-year production volumes and cash flows at a minimum average rate in excess of 40 percent over the next three years without additional acquisition or exploration success.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Swift gained 1-1/2 to 26-1/2.</p>
